            "sid": "DEU 7:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mkore milimu yawo; msekaie na bea ingi ya feza angu dhahabu rishingilo aighu yaro, hata mseiwuse mchengia mdeghonyi; kwa kukaia radamzamia BWANA Mlungu onyu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.7.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.7.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
